## Modifications in this fork

This fork (https://github.com/devedge09/kiro-grc-engineering) was
created by devedge09 to port the toolkit for use with Kiro
(https://kiro.dev) in environments where npm packages cannot be
installed.

Changes made (no GRC content was altered):

  - Removed npm dependencies: js-yaml, dotenv, @octokit/rest
  - Added yaml-shim.mjs: zero-dependency YAML parser using Node built-ins
  - Replaced dotenv with an inline .env reader using fs/promises
  - Replaced @octokit/rest with gh CLI calls via execSync
  - Converted CJS (require/module.exports) scripts to ESM imports
  - Added kiro/ directory with Kiro steering and agent configuration files

